        <mxCell id="n8" value="&lt;b&gt;Natural-language intents&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left'&gt;• finance may reach database over PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).&lt;br&gt;• dev-lab may use any TCP port towards ops, except Telnet (TCP 23), which must be blocked.&lt;br&gt;• cameras is isolated: it may only reach nvr on RTSP (TCP 554), and nothing else.&lt;br&gt;• guest-wifi must never reach finance, regardless of any other rule.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1b1b1b;align=center;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="53" y="79" width="228" height="199" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
